    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95970" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπλήν</span></b> , ὁ, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπληνός</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>milt, spleen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				506.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				222.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ς. ἐκβαλεῖν</span>, of one
			dying with anxiety, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπλῆνες</span>, <i>affections of the
			spleen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγὸς ς.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολόχη</span>
			, <i>mallow</i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.118
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπληνίον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. (Prob. cogn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπλάγχνον</span> and with Skt.
			<i>plīhán-</i>, Lat. <i>lien</i>, Slav.
				<i>slězena</i>, Lith.
				<i>blužnìs.</i>)</div>
